<ProjectLayout
  title="Airbus Helicopters"
  category="Experience | Aerospace"
  year="Nov 2021 | Dec 2021"
  description="Industrial technician experience at Airbus Helicopters in Paris-Le Bourget, focused on composite manufacturing equipment, hydraulics and RTM process troubleshooting."
>

  <p slot="intro">
    An early experience in aerospace manufacturing focused on composite production equipment,
    hydraulic systems and industrial troubleshooting.
  </p>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      01
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Context
      </h2>

      <p>
        I joined Airbus Helicopters at Paris-Le Bourget as an Industrial Technician,
        working in an environment combining aerospace manufacturing, composite processes
        and industrial equipment.
      </p>

      <p>
        This experience gave me an early introduction to the level of reliability,
        repeatability and process control required in the aerospace industry.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      02
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Composite manufacturing
      </h2>

      <p>
        I participated in the commissioning of composite blade molding equipment,
        with a focus on improving the reliability of the production cycle.
      </p>

      <p>
        The work contributed to a reported improvement in cycle reliability of 17%.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      03
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Hydraulic systems
      </h2>

      <p>
        I worked on the calibration of a hydraulic group used within the manufacturing
        equipment.
      </p>

      <p>
        The calibration was optimized to improve flow stability, with a reported
        improvement of 10%.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      04
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        RTM troubleshooting
      </h2>

      <p>
        I contributed to the troubleshooting of a Resin Transfer Molding machine,
        with the objective of identifying the main point of failure affecting its operation.
      </p>

      <p>
        This required observing the machine behaviour, understanding the interaction
        between its mechanical and hydraulic functions and isolating the most critical
        source of failure.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


