  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      06
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Perspective
      </h2>

      <p>
        This experience reinforced my interest in complex industrial systems,
        particularly where mechanical engineering, hydraulics, composite manufacturing
